							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">Peep the source: <a href="http&#58;//www.soundcircuit.com/wackwatch/covers/" target="_blank">http://www.soundcircuit.com/wackwatch/covers/</a><br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"><img src="http://www.soundcircuit.com/wackwatch/covers/cover_tic.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />-Mommy, where do babies come from?<br />-Well dear, when two people love each other very much, the man sticks his dick in a thug&#039;s ear and impregnates his head. Apparently, thugs don&#039;t need much space in there for a brain.<br /><br /><img src="http://www.soundcircuit.com/wackwatch/covers/cover_blackmagic.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />Ever wonder what Bruce Leroy&#039;s been up to since the Last Dragon?<br /><br /><img src="http://www.soundcircuit.com/wackwatch/covers/cover_ballers.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />It used to be apples and oranges, but we ballin&#039; for the new millenium, wodie. In 2001, it&#039;s all about dem pineapples, ya heard me. We got a whole fruit basket fo&#039; you haterz. How u luv dat, playboi?<br /><br /><img src="http://www.soundcircuit.com/wackwatch/covers/cover_southern.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />Outkast was originally going to use this for the cover to their debut album. They went through some turmoil with their label and finally got it approved. They decided not to go with it, however, after realizing at the last minute...it sucks.<br /><br /><img src="http://www.soundcircuit.com/wackwatch/covers/cover_bloodthirsty.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />This cover brings back memories. I remember the time my associates and I were trapped in large bubbles, while being chased by a giant, flying demon hound with glowing eyes. We never went back to that club again. <br /><br /><img src="http://www.soundcircuit.com/wackwatch/covers/cover_bigbear.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />Oh this cover&#039;s real tight. Instead of two girls next to him &amp; some bodyguards behind him, he&#039;s surrounded by bears. Yogi has some competition for the smartest bear now.<br /><br /><img src="http://www.soundcircuit.com/wackwatch/covers/cover_kilo.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />SoundCircuit.com has some exclusive news! Kilo and Big Bear are teaming up to do a straight-to-home video called &quot;<span style="text-decoration: underline;">When Animals Attack...In Da Ghetto! Vol.1</span>&quot;<br /><br /><img src="http://www.soundcircuit.com/wackwatch/covers/cover_herbman.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />The rapper&#039;s name, album title, and caption are all one in the same. Go fig.<br /><br /><img src="http://www.soundcircuit.com/wackwatch/covers/cover_ctown.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />Now we know what happened to Boyz II Men.<br /><br /><img src="http://www.soundcircuit.com/wackwatch/covers/cover_hustlin.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />Who says smoking stunts your growth? Look at me...I&#039;ve been smoking for 200 years and I&#039;m 25 feet tall! Oh yes, and the bitches love me.<br /></div><br />Some of the funniest cover descriptions I&#039;ve ever read!</div>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext" width="85%">
							<table width="100%" border="0" style="table-layout: fixed;"><tr>
